---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Intro from '../components/mark/intro.mdx'
import NonInteractive from '../components/mark/non_interactive.mdx'
---
<Layout title="Introduction | ZK Proofs" pageTitle="Introduction">
    <Fragment slot="lesson-title">Introduction to <br />Zero-Knowledge Proofs</Fragment>

    <Intro />

    <table>
        <tr>
            <th>Property</th>
            <th>Interactive</th>
            <th>Non-Interactive</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <th>Communication</th>
            <td>Requires back-and-forth communication between the prover and verifier</td>
            <td>Prover generates single proof that can be verified independently</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <th>Verifier Involvement</th>
            <td>Active participation</td>
            <td>No active participation</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <th>Risk of Collusion</th>
            <td>Higher - verifier can collude with prover</td>
            <td>Lower - verifier has no involvement in the proof generation</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <th>Proof of Generation Complexity</th>
            <td>Higher - due to back-and-forth communication</td>
            <td>Lower - avoids multiple rounds of communication</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <th>Vulnerability</th>
            <td>Verifier’s secret values need to be stored securely</td>
            <td>Verifier’s secret values are not involved</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <th>Typical Use Cases</th>
            <td>Limited due to complexity and interaction requirement</td>
            <td>Widely used in blockchain and cryptographic protocols for efficiency</td>
        </tr>
    </table>
    <br />

    <NonInteractive />

    <!-- <label for="message">Ask a question</label>
        <input
        id="message"
        name="message"
        type="text"
        placeholder="Enter your question..."
    /> -->
</Layout>

<style>
    table, th, td {
        border: 1px solid #00697b;
        border-collapse: collapse;
    }
</style>
